Hey, HN!

It is with excitement that we present our development - Fremo mobile app. We've tailored every feature to meet your needs, ensuring a truly indispensable tool.

With our app, you can enjoy the following features:

- Add a tasks within projects and track time;
- Set an hourly rate for each project;
- Generate an invoice for the selected period;
- Analyze your daily work activity with statistics to evaluate your productivity;
- Control the timer with the Lock Screen Widget.

I hope you will like our project. We would welcome any feedback!

Sincerely, Guild Team
